Habilitar

Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName Client-DeviceLockdown,Client-EmbeddedShellLauncher -All

Outra aplicação 

$Shell = [wmiclass]"\\localhost\root\standardcimv2\embedded:WESL_UserSetting"

$Shell.SetDefaultShell("powershell.exe", 0)
$Shell.SetEnabled($true)

Voltar para o explorer

$Shell = [wmiclass]"\\localhost\root\standardcimv2\embedded:WESL_UserSetting"

$Shell.SetDefaultShell("explorer.exe", 0)
$Shell.SetEnabled($false)

Exemplo Steam: 

$Shell = [wmiclass]"\\localhost\root\standardcimv2\embedded:WESL_UserSetting"

$Steam = '"C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steam.exe" -bigpicture'

$Shell.SetDefaultShell($Steam, 3)
$Shell.SetEnabled($true)
